Package: anpr
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: LogicClutch <ankit@logicclutch.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @PYDEP@, libgl1, libglib2.0-0, ffmpeg, sqlite3, curl, passwd
Recommends: rpicam-apps
Description: Indian number plate recognition (ANPR) for Raspberry Pi 3B+
 Reads number plates from a camera or RTSP stream, stores them in SQLite and
 serves a web dashboard + API on port 8000. Includes its own Python
 environment, so no internet or pip is needed on the Pi.
 Needs Raspberry Pi OS 64-bit and a licence for the device.
